    "summary": "The findings expose a significant gap between deploying AI tools and the operating capabilities needed to integrate them into how work gets done across an organization. The report argues that when AI remains confined to individual functions, its value remains trapped in silos, limiting organizations’ ability to translate AI investment into measurable returns across the enterprise. The AI-ready workplace distinguishes measuring AI’s broader business impact from continuously connecting AI use to workflow outcomes and using that evidence to guide investment. Lenovo is a US$83 billion revenue global technology powerhouse, ranked #153 in the Fortune Global 500, and serving millions of customers every day in 180 markets.",
