    "publishedAt": "2026-10-12",
    "summary": "This reflects its holistic approach across compute, cooling, power, and connectivity. Through close collaboration with AMD, Wiwynn is applying its rack integration and manufacturing expertise to bring this architecture to customers at scale with solutions tailored to CSP requirements. 6kW Double-Sided Cold Plate with Cavity PCBA and VPD : An ultra-thin double-sided cold plate with cavity PCBA design for high-power AI ASICs using Vertical Power Delivery, delivering 6kW cooling capacity, over15% thermal performance improvement, and up to 80% reduction in power delivery loss. Lightweight Cold Plate and Inner Manifold Design : Through reduced metal usage in cold plates and inner manifolds, along with lightweight tubing, Wiwynn cuts cooling component weight by at least 30%, streamlining integration, transportation, and installation for high-density AI racks as deployments scale worldwide.",
    "whyItMatters": "对立讯的意义在于高速互连从服务器内部延伸到光链路，需观察光器件产能、客户认证和连接方案是否改变。",
