    "publishedAt": "2026-11-16",
    "summary": "With more than 6,500 customers 2 already running this foundation, these announcements build on the momentum of NVIDIA GTC Berlin and prove that an end-to-end approach from one trusted partner is how enterprises move agentic AI from experimentation to production with confidence. Dell is expanding the Exascale portfolio with the world’s first direct-liquid cooled (DLC) storage for rack-scale AI, 5 a high-density 1U form factor, plus NVIDIA certification to give cloud service providers a proven AI storage foundation and more deployment choice. The 2-OU, 100% DLC platform will support up to 32 NVMe drives and simplify rack design, deployment and expansion as AI environments scale. 7 One view with rack context reduces tool sprawl and lets teams investigate and resolve issues across system health, alerts, firmware, inventory, power and performance using natural language, resulting in faster deployment and more predictable changes at scale.",
