    "summary": "30 quarterly report shows a nine-month net profit of ¥132.0 billion ($19.6 billion), against a ¥5.28 billion ($785 million) loss a year earlier, on revenue more than eight times as high, at ¥269.0 billion ($40.0 billion). CXMT’s prospectus lists no HBM project , though its HBM3E is reportedly in risk production , an early run before the process is fully qualified. Third-quarter profit alone was ¥54.4 billion ($8.1 billion). A third fab in the Xinzhou district , registered in September last year, is expected to produce about 50,000 wafers a month by 2027 and eventually 100,000 at full capacity.",
